pack mkp-learn@1 "Learning pieces: quizzes (choice, numeric, expression, cloze, order, find-error, self-check, sets), worked steps, theorem cards, annotated source and scenarios."
  requires core@1
  depends mkp-ui@1
  provides quiz.numeric quiz.choice quiz.expression quiz.cloze quiz.gap quiz.order quiz.find-error quiz.self-check quiz.set worked-steps theorem annotated-source scenario
